()\"), the migration guide's translation of a\nno-value @Authorized, denied a logged-out caller with a plain\nAuthorizationDeniedException where @Authorized throws\nAPIAuthenticationException, so converting such a method changed what its\ncallers catch. It now records the denial for\nPrivilegeNamingAuthorizationManager to report as AuthorizationAdvice does.\n\nTestInstallUtil throws APIAuthenticationException again, as before 3.0.0,\nand the migration guide notes that the class is no longer an APIException.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WMHrjRkMgotZngQzt31zSK\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","authorName":"dkayiwa","authorEmail":"dkayiwa@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"a69b14a84bf925ff7cdf34e93ca1ffb4f257265f","date":"2026-10-08T15:44:45+02:00","message":"TRUNK-6799 Introduce Spring Security with support for legacy authentication context (#6544)","refs":"","body":"Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","authorName":"Rafal Korytkowski","authorEmail":"rafal.korytkowski@gmail.com"},{"hash":"3310bc1d9682151ac461faf0916ca3da7d5a88d0","date":"2026-08-26T14:06:08-04:00","message":"TRUNK-6705: Follow-up: Re-add null privilege check and add guards","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Ian","authorEmail":"ian.c.bacher@gmail.com"},{"hash":"1d0fb13892759020f6bc0824a097518d546024eb","date":"2026-08-26T13:45:08-04:00","message":"TRUNK-6705: Reduce the overhead of the gzip filter (#6505)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Ian","authorEmail":"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"1b5421a9a8d69030adb91124c3f9cb758dbc58a8","date":"2026-07-24T11:14:02-04:00","message":"TRUNK-6712: Cache flattened role privileges for privilege and superuser checks (#6383)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Ian","authorEmail":"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"84963803c794accceb19cf2236b859c747371336","date":"2026-07-01T13:43:53+02:00","message":"Fix